  "headline_findings": [
    "Bigram analysis identified work-life balance and competitive compensation as the most positively associated factors.",
    "Job security emerged as the most frequently criticised aspect.",
    "Structural Topic Modeling identified eight topics covering five dominant EVP dimensions that IT professionals prioritise.",
    "Emphasis on management quality and economic value grew over the period, while joy at work declined."
  ],
  "research_questions": [
    "What do employees in the IT industry discuss about their workplace on a job posting crowdsourced website?",
    "Do those reviews differ based on the status of employees, time of review, and type of reviews?",
    "What can managers, policymakers, and HR specialists learn from employees' praises and complaints about their workplaces?"
  ]
}